      "content": "It's generally not recommended to double the dose of iron supplements without consulting a doctor, as this can increase the risk of iron overload and other adverse effects. Instead, consider taking your son to see his pediatrician or a healthcare professional to determine the best course of treatment for his anemia. A proper diagnosis and personalized treatment plan can ensure he receives the necessary amount of iron.",
